{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream Nest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the director\u2019s chair and weave your cinematic dreams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dream Nest</i>, you become a film director, crafting unique movies through an innovative <strong>storyboard selection + AI generation</strong> system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storyboard Choices</strong>: Pick one shot from four unique storyboards at each stage, ultimately forming a sequence of 12 key frames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Generated Films</strong>: Feed your selected storyboards to AI and watch a complete movie come to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Actor Casting</strong>: Choose your cast\u2014each AI actor brings a different style and performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Budget &amp; Box Office Simulation</strong>: Balance investment efficiency against box office returns in a realistic filmmaking economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Line Ending</strong>: Rewrite the entire ending of your film with a single line of text\u2014the ultimate director\u2019s touch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Atmosphere</strong>: From the chaos of the set to the thrill of the premiere, every moment brims with filmic vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Film Styles</strong>: Experience <strong>2D ink-painting animation</strong> and <strong>Republic of China\u2013era live-action films</strong>, with more styles to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directorial Freedom</strong>: You are the storyboard artist, the producer, and the storyteller\u2014your choices shape the soul of the film.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dream Nest</i>, every film becomes an extension of your imagination.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048890?t=1761329607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048890/445a472c41f72a8d670de3b362d1e66118016bb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761329607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048890/2f988baccc23c492ea4592cf4e244c590153ab93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761329607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048890/2f988baccc23c492ea4592cf4e244c590153ab93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761329607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream Nest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the director\u2019s chair and weave your cinematic dreams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dream Nest</i>, you become a film director, crafting unique movies through an innovative <strong>storyboard selection + AI generation</strong> system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storyboard Choices</strong>: Pick one shot from four unique storyboards at each stage, ultimately forming a sequence of 12 key frames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Generated Films</strong>: Feed your selected storyboards to AI and watch a complete movie come to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Actor Casting</strong>: Choose your cast\u2014each AI actor brings a different style and performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Budget &amp; Box Office Simulation</strong>: Balance investment efficiency against box office returns in a realistic filmmaking economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Line Ending</strong>: Rewrite the entire ending of your film with a single line of text\u2014the ultimate director\u2019s touch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Atmosphere</strong>: From the chaos of the set to the thrill of the premiere, every moment brims with filmic vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Film Styles</strong>: Experience <strong>2D ink-painting animation</strong> and <strong>Republic of China\u2013era live-action films</strong>, with more styles to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directorial Freedom</strong>: You are the storyboard artist, the producer, and the storyteller\u2014your choices shape the soul of the film.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dream Nest</i>, every film becomes an extension of your imagination.</p>","developers":["Three Old Pals","Blair Xie"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048890/4baf9e5fc28c2709dca9a50d0fbda7bf2b303229/header.jpg?t=1761329607","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048890/1910851948/d989c22fe5ba6d54787afac81a9d512dba09258b/1760185715/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761329604","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048890/1910851948/d989c22fe5ba6d54787afac81a9d512dba09258b/1760185715/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761329604","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048890/1910851948/d989c22fe5ba6d54787afac81a9d512dba09258b/1760185715/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761329604","id":257216044,"name":"Dream Nest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216044/35ef96